units metal
dimension 3
boundary p p p
atom_style atomic
newton on
neighbor 2 bin
neigh_modify delay 0 every 1 check yes
timestep 0.001
reset_timestep 0
lattice fcc 4.05
region box block 0 5 0 5 0 5 units lattice
create_box 1 box
create_atoms 1 box
pair_style eam/alloy
pair_coeff * * ../../../potentials/prompt1.potential Al
velocity all create 300 12345 mom yes rot yes dist gaussian
thermo 100
thermo_style custom step temp press pe ke etotal vol
fix 1 all npt temp 300 300 0.1 iso 1.01325 1.01325 1
run 500000
unfix 1
